Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Okay so there's something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}in the Mahabharata that's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}more {\c&H00D4FF&}dangerous{\c&HFFFFFF&} than any
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:04.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}{\c&H00D4FF&}villain.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:05.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}And honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:06.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Most of us have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:07.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Stay till the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}I'll tell you what it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:08.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:09.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}So I was reading this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:10.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Substack article
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}The Mahabharata and its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Flawed Heroes by Sidhima
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:13.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Shekhawat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:14.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}and her whole point is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:15.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}basically this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}the epic doesn't tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}how to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:18.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}It shows you how complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}living is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:20.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}It's not good versus evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Everyone has reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Everyone has {\c&H00D4FF&}wounds.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}She uses the characters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:25.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}to explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}And every one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:26.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}teaches us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Bhishma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:28.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}He makes a vow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:28.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}And it turns into {\c&H00D4FF&}silence{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}while injustice is happening
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:32.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}right in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:32.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Lesson one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}staying {\c&H00D4FF&}neutral{\c&HFFFFFF&} isn't {\c&H00D4FF&}innocent.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:34.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}It's a {\c&H00D4FF&}choice.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}And it has {\c&H00D4FF&}consequences.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:36.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Karna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:37.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:39.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}But he's so tied to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}an old injustice that he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}stays loyal to the {\c&H00D4FF&}wrong{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:41.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:42.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Lesson two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:43.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}unresolved pain can quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:45.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}become who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:45.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Yudhishthira.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:47.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}He follows dharma so rigidly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}that it {\c&H00D4FF&}freezes{\c&HFFFFFF&} him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:48.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Lesson three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:49.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}ethics without {\c&H00D4FF&}courage{\c&HFFFFFF&} can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}do real harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:51.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}But then there are the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:53.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}ones who did nothing {\c&H00D4FF&}wrong.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.65,0:00:54.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Eklavya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Disciplined
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:55.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}gifted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:56.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}punished because his talent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:58.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}threatened other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:58.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}He loses his {\c&H00D4FF&}thumb.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:00:59.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}And Draupadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Humiliated in public by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:02.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}the very people who should've
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:03.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}protected her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:03.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}And afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:04.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}She gets {\c&H00D4FF&}blamed{\c&HFFFFFF&} for the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:05.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}war.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:06.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.26,0:01:07.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}{\c&H00D4FF&}Wronged{\c&HFFFFFF&} and then {\c&H00D4FF&}blamed.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:08.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}So why did the war
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:09.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}even happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:10.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Because both sides were
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:11.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}completely {\c&H00D4FF&}sure{\c&HFFFFFF&} they were
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.96,0:01:12.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:13.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}That's the {\c&H00D4FF&}dangerous{\c&HFFFFFF&} thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:14.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:15.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Moral {\c&H00D4FF&}certainty.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:16.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}She says it can be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:18.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}more {\c&H00D4FF&}dangerous{\c&HFFFFFF&} than moral
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:18.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:19.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Both sides believed they
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:20.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}were fighting for what was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:21.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:22.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Neither would back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:24.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}And when it was over
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}everyone was just tired
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:26.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}and hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:27.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}No winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:28.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Just {\c&H00D4FF&}grief.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:29.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}So the lesson isn't pick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:29.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}the right side
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:31.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}because everyone thought
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:31.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:32.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}The lesson is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:34.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}be careful how {\c&H00D4FF&}sure{\c&HFFFFFF&} you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:34.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:36.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Even Krishna bent the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}to stop a bigger harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:38.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Life's lived in the {\c&H00D4FF&}grey{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:40.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}and good intentions don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:42.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}erase {\c&H00D4FF&}consequences.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}That's why we keep coming
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:44.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}back to this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:46.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}It doesn't comfort us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:47.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}It understands us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:48.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}So if you've ever been
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}{\c&H00D4FF&}wronged{\c&HFFFFFF&} and then {\c&H00D4FF&}blamed{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:50.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}for it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}this story sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:52.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Follow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:53.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}and I'll bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:54.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,50)}Substack stories like this.